# Cloudflare static-asset headers.
#
# X-Robots-Tag  — the header form of noindex. Unlike robots.txt it also covers
#                 responses a crawler reaches without reading robots.txt first,
#                 and unlike the <meta> tag it applies to every asset, not just
#                 index.html.
# Referrer-Policy — the app's API calls go out to script.google.com. Without
#                 this, the Referer header would carry this app's hostname to
#                 Google on every request. Don't leak the internal URL.

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
